'''Archangel Exiel''' (大天使エクスエル ''Daitenshi Ekusueru'', '''Archangel Exel''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Mr. Angel]] unique to the [[Divine Archangel Strikes]] event. He was added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Archangel Exiel
|image = E 593.png
|appearance = [[Divine Archangel Strikes]]
|money drop = 750¢ - 2,962¢
}}

==Enemy==
Archangel Exiel is a hard-pushing boss. He isn't the most durable and has a very low standing range of 210, but his Omni Strikes hit up to 260 range, occur almost every second with a 2-second warp and 15-second weaken, often making him the main threat, more so in the presence of nasty peons like [[Aku Gory]], [[Shadow Boxer K]], [[Dark Otter]], [[Capy]], [[Bore Jr.]] and [[Mr. Mer]]. Even if serviceable counters are at hand, he still shouldn't be taken lightly.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Divine Archangel Strikes/Blessing Lv.1~20]].''

