==Trivia==
*The name Exiel may be derived from ''XL'' (Extra Large, referring to his [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossal]] stature), ''exile'' (either referring to how his warp "exiles" units from the [[Battle|battle]], or common depictions of fallen angels having been 'exiled' from heaven) and ''El'' (the Hebrew word for God, commonly used as a suffix in angel names).
*Archangel Exiel, [[Heavenly Le'saint]] and [[Great Angel Chibinel]] all have the word 大天使 ''daitenshi'' (archangel; lit. "great angel") in their Japanese names.
**Heavenly Le'saint is the only one who isn't a Colossus.
*He is one of the six enemies that were updated to have the Colossus type in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], the others being [[Baron Seal]], [[Le'Grim]], [[Mega-Mooth]], [[Super Hyppoh]] and [[Big Peng Z]].

